# text = I would have laughed at every single one of those suggestions — and yet here I am, in a city, driving a car to an office, in a tie, with black coffee in my cup and an opera ticket in my pocket, wondering when exactly all of that happened and whether the person I was then would recognize, let alone approve of, the person I am now.
